00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:12,343
In Group three A, ammonium chloride keeps hydroxide low, so iron, aluminium and chromium hydroxides precipitate while magnesium hydroxide stays dissolved.

2
00:00:12,343 --> 00:00:21,432
And adding hydrogen chloride gas to brine, or common salt to soap, throws out pure sodium chloride or soap by the same principle.

